WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
- So you've been at 30 Rock
forever now, I feel like.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:02.953
- Yeah,

00:00:02.953 --> 00:00:05.730
- Yeah, no matter the job.
So, so do you get along

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:06.900
with everybody in the
building or is there like

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.920
one guy that's like, oh,
every time you walk in?

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.120
- No, I've been there for 25 years now.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:11.953
Isn't that crazy?

00:00:11.953 --> 00:00:12.986
- [Kelly] That. Wow.

00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:14.080
(audience cheers)

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.350
- At NBC going in the same
elevators. It's bizarre.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.183
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:19.150
- I know everyone there.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.420
At one point I used to have
like keys to different offices

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.139
and stuff because Dan
Akeroyd came to the show

00:00:25.139 --> 00:00:26.720
and was so nice to me.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.880
And he was like, "So you're the new kid?"

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.670
I go, "Yeah." He goes,
"Hey, Jimmy, come with me.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.620
I'll go show you this spot."

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.970
He goes, "I used to hang out
with all the security guards,"

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.870
and he goes, "Me and Belushi
would come down to this area."

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.917
And we crawled, we broke into an office.

00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:39.557
This is serious. Crawl through a window.

00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:42.150
And we went out and the outdoor was this

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.120
giant beautiful lawn, like a patio.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.070
That's just like on the 11th floor.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.230
And we went out and it's
just a gorgeous place.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.540
It was like an old, like back
in the day they used to have

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.960
Tuscanini, his office, but
him and Belushi and Akeroyd

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.685
would go and-
- Just get high up there?

00:00:56.685 --> 00:00:57.518
- [Jimmy] Yeah.

00:00:57.518 --> 00:00:58.351
- Yeah.

00:00:58.351 --> 00:00:59.184
- Thank you for saying that.
I wasn't going to say it.

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.066
I was trying to think how to say it.

00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:00.950
- I have a security meeting.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.238
- Maybe we were going to read books.

00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:04.347
- Have a security meeting and
make sure everything is good.

00:01:04.347 --> 00:01:05.557
- (laughs) Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:05.557 --> 00:01:06.610
- That's what we would call it.

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.070
- So were friends with
all the security guys.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.870
So we would go around,
just break into stuff,

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:11.707
and just have fun.

00:01:11.707 --> 00:01:12.820
- I love how he's like,
"Oh, you're the new guy.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.486
Let me show you to break
and enter." (laughter)

00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:15.367
- Like, that's amazing.

